    rdfs:comment "Corrected from 'Assign Participants to Arm' (OOUX v0.2): arm assignment is performed by the randomization system (cr:RandomizationEvent, attributed to the IxRS) and is blinded — no site role can perform or know it. The human-performable act is REQUESTING randomization for an eligible, consented participant." ;
